{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-20 05:20:32 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-SessionContext] [Project: session_context_research] Starting deep investigation of ExecutionContext flow and session isolation failures. Research goal: Trace complete flow from MCP request to tool execution, identify session ID mismatch between set_project and append_entry, propose architectural fix. | confidence=1; entry_type=research_start; reasoning={\"how\": \"Systematic code investigation: server.py (MCP router), execution_context.py, session_utils.py, logging_utils.py, set_project.py, append_entry.py\", \"what\": \"Need to trace ExecutionContext creation, session ID sources (session_id vs stable_session_id), context propagation paths, and find exact mismatch point\", \"why\": \"Session isolation is failing - set_project creates binding with one session_key, append_entry looks up with different key, falls back to global state\"}; stage=research; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/session_context_research/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-20T05:20:32.801132+00:00_1beef443", "timestamp": "2026-01-20T05:20:32.801175+00:00"}
