{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-20 05:21:45 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-SessionContext] [Project: session_context_research] Found set_project session binding logic: Gets stable_session_id from exec_context, uses it as session_key (line 513: session_key = stable_session_id or context_session_id or session_id), calls backend.set_session_project(session_key, name) to create binding in session_projects table. | confidence=0.95; entry_type=finding; file=tools/set_project.py; lines=456-530; reasoning={\"how\": \"Code inspection of set_project.py session binding logic\", \"what\": \"set_project gets stable_session_id from ExecutionContext, uses it as session_key with fallback chain (stable_session_id > context_session_id > session_id), calls backend.set_session_project(session_key, name) to create binding\", \"why\": \"Need to understand how set_project creates session bindings\"}; stage=research; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/session_context_research/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-20T05:21:45.067987+00:00_13785bda", "timestamp": "2026-01-20T05:21:45.068029+00:00"}
