{"op": "append", "content": "[\u274c] [2026-01-20 05:25:43 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-SessionContext] [Project: session_context_research] SMOKING GUN FOUND! Debug logs show: read_file uses agent_key='default' \u2192 stable_session_id=4ec1a4e8... \u2192 finds project. But append_entry uses agent_key='ResearchAgent-SessionContext' \u2192 stable_session_id=54cf887e... \u2192 NO project found! Both use same transport_session_id and scope_key, but DIFFERENT agent_key creates DIFFERENT identity_hash and DIFFERENT stable_session_id! | confidence=1; entry_type=root_cause; reasoning={\"how\": \"Analysis of /tmp/scribe_session_debug.log showing identical transport_session_id but different agent_key values\", \"what\": \"Root cause: agent parameter differs between tools - read_file doesn't pass agent (defaults to 'default'), append_entry passes agent='ResearchAgent-SessionContext', causing different identity_hash and different stable_session_id\", \"why\": \"Need to find actual mismatch in production debug logs\"}; severity=critical; stage=research; priority=high; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/session_context_research/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-20T05:25:43.492424+00:00_eaabc517", "timestamp": "2026-01-20T05:25:43.492460+00:00"}
