{"op": "append", "content": "[\u274c] [2026-01-20 05:27:00 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-SessionContext] [Project: session_context_research] Confirmed: set_project bound session_context_research to stable_session_id=4ec1a4e8... (agent_key='default'). But append_entry looks up with stable_session_id=54cf887e... (agent_key='ResearchAgent-SessionContext'). The agent parameter is being included in the identity hash, fragmenting sessions by agent name! | confidence=1; entry_type=root_cause_confirmed; reasoning={\"how\": \"Cross-referenced set_project binding logs with append_entry lookup logs - different agent_key values produce different stable_session_id values\", \"what\": \"set_project uses stable_session_id from agent_key='default', append_entry uses different stable_session_id from agent_key='ResearchAgent-SessionContext', causing lookup failure\", \"why\": \"Need to verify the exact session keys used in set_project binding vs append_entry lookup\"}; severity=critical; stage=research; priority=high; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/session_context_research/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-20T05:27:00.491870+00:00_1822f02e", "timestamp": "2026-01-20T05:27:00.491905+00:00"}
