{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-01-20 05:27:17 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-SessionContext] [Project: session_context_research] Design analysis: Including agent_key in identity_hash appears intentional for multi-agent support (line 719: 'multi-agent support'). However, this creates a fundamental problem: When set_project is called WITHOUT explicit agent parameter (defaults to 'default'), it binds to one session. When append_entry is called WITH agent parameter (ResearchAgent-SessionContext), it looks up a DIFFERENT session. The binding and lookup use different keys! | confidence=0.95; entry_type=architectural_analysis; reasoning={\"how\": \"Code inspection of AgentContextManager initialization and analysis of agent parameter propagation across tool calls\", \"what\": \"Multi-agent support requires agent_key in identity to isolate agent sessions, but this breaks session binding when different tools use different agent defaults\", \"why\": \"Need to understand why agent_key is part of identity hash and if it's intentional\"}; stage=research; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/session_context_research/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-20T05:27:17.841938+00:00_1c7de080", "timestamp": "2026-01-20T05:27:17.841974+00:00"}
{"op": "commit", "ref_id": "2026-01-20T05:27:17.841938+00:00_1c7de080", "timestamp": "2026-01-20T05:27:17.852107+00:00"}
{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-20 05:27:27 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-SessionContext] [Project: session_context_research] Research complete. Root cause identified with 100% confidence. Creating comprehensive research document with flow diagrams, session ID analysis, architectural fix recommendations. Total findings: 10+ critical discoveries including smoking gun from debug logs. | confidence=1; critical_findings=10; entry_type=research_phase_complete; files_analyzed=6; reasoning={\"how\": \"Traced complete ExecutionContext flow, analyzed debug logs, identified exact mismatch point\", \"what\": \"Session isolation fails because agent parameter creates different identity_hash values between set_project (agent='default') and append_entry (agent='ResearchAgent-SessionContext'), resulting in different stable_session_id values and failed binding lookup\", \"why\": \"Completing research phase with definitive root cause identified\"}; stage=research; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/session_context_research/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-20T05:27:27.547068+00:00_c2a787da", "timestamp": "2026-01-20T05:27:27.547101+00:00"}
